# NetShare — Environment Variables

# ─── Supabase ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get these from: Supabase Dashboard → Settings → API

# Your project's API URL (safe to commit, not a secret)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT_REF.supabase.co

# Supabase publishable/anon key (safe to expose in browser, protected by RLS)
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY

# ─── DO NOT ADD THESE TO CLIENT CODE ─────────────────────────────────────────
# The service role key has full database bypass and must NEVER be used
# in any file prefixed with NEXT_PUBLIC_ or sent to the browser.
# If you need server-only Supabase operations, create a separate server
# client with the service role key and keep it in a Route Handler only.
#
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-secret-service-role-key  ← NEVER expose this
